      "widgets_values": [
        "IMAGE TO IMAGE — restyling.\n\nThe Editor takes YOUR image plus a prompt describing what should change. Here the prompt asks for a medium/style translation (watercolor scene -> vector travel poster) while the composition carries over from the input.\n\nUPLOAD YOUR OWN: click 'choose file to upload' on the Load Image node. Photos, scans of your sketchbook, previous generations — anything.\n\nPROMPT PATTERN: describe the DESTINATION, not the journey. Say what the result should be ('a flat vector poster with...'), and anchor what must survive ('this scene').\n\nEXERCISE: run the same source through three destinations — a woodcut print, a child's crayon drawing, an architectural blueprint. Which features of your source does each style keep?"
      ],
